    {
      "source": "Defaults to the JDK style (<a href=\"DurationFormat.Style.html#ISO8601\"><code>DurationFormat.Style.ISO8601</code></a>).",
      "translation": "默认为 JDK 风格（<a href=\"DurationFormat.Style.html#ISO8601\"><code>DurationFormat.Style.ISO8601</code></a>）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Defaults to <a href=\"DurationFormat.Unit.html#MILLIS\"><code>DurationFormat.Unit.MILLIS</code></a> if unspecified.",
      "translation": "默认为<a href=\"DurationFormat.Unit.html#MILLIS\"><code>DurationFormat.Unit.MILLIS</code></a>（如果未指定）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Declares that a field or method parameter should be formatted as a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a>, according to the specified <a href=\"#style()\"><code>Style</code></a>\nand <a href=\"#defaultUnit()\"><code>Unit</code></a>.",
      "translation": "声明字段或方法参数应按指定的<a href=\"#style()\"><code>Style</code></a>和<a href=\"#defaultUnit()\"><code>Unit</code></a>格式化为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"DurationFormat.Unit.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.format.annotation\"><code>DurationFormat.Unit</code></a> to fall back to in case the <a href=\"#style()\"><code>Style</code></a> needs a unit\nfor either parsing or printing, and none is explicitly provided in the input.",
      "translation": "`<a href=\"DurationFormat.Unit.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.format.annotation\"><code>DurationFormat.Unit</code></a>` 作为后备选项，当 `<a href=\"#style()\"><code>Style</code></a>` 需要单位用于解析或打印，且输入中未显式提供时。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"DurationFormat.Style.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.format.annotation\"><code>DurationFormat.Style</code></a> to use for parsing and printing a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于解析和打印<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a>的<a href=\"DurationFormat.Style.html\" title=\"org.springframework.format.annotation 中的枚举类\"><code>DurationFormat.Style</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a> format unit, which mirrors a subset of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/temporal/ChronoUnit.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.temporal\"><code>ChronoUnit</code></a> and\nallows conversion to and from a supported <code>ChronoUnit</code> as well as\nconversion from durations to longs.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a> 格式单位，它反映了 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/temporal/ChronoUnit.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time.temporal\"><code>ChronoUnit</code></a> 的子集，并允许转换为支持的 <code>ChronoUnit</code> 以及从持续时间转换为长整型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a> format styles.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a> 格式样式。",
      "count": 1
